  "problem": "The velocity $v$ of a particle at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=4{t}^{3}-2{t}^{2}+9t.$ Calculate the acceleration $a$ of the particle at time $t.$\n\n$a(t)=$\n{{field-1}}",
